          "speaker_role": "北洋海棠基金合伙人",
          "rationale": "认为长期记忆是大模型从一次性对话工具进化为长期协作者的必要缺失部分，MemoraX AI团队兼具技术积累与工程实践经验，其记忆基座将成为下一代AI应用默认调用的基础设施。",
          "quote": "Long-term memory is a necessary missing part for large models to evolve from 'one-time dialogue tools' to 'long-term collaborators'. The context window solves the width of a single task, while memory solves the continuity across cycles. The MemoraX AI team has both profound technical accumulation and engineering practical experience, and their work in the field of memory models is groundbreaking.",
